everything from physical fields to abstract human decision-making.

44
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:11,520
Yeah.

45
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,720
And maybe most importantly,

46
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:15,340
we'll discover how boundaries aren't just inert walls.

