we're going to connect planetary engineering to statistical probability

55
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:41,540
and biological tissue regeneration to the pure mathematics of irreversible choices.

56
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:43,640
Which sounds insane until you read the math.

57
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,160
Exactly.

58
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:48,460
And the anchor for all of this, the hidden gear turning all this machinery,

59
